吗？我明白了。","alt":"voice/char_4036_forcer/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:6/6c/8lc0vx6rmdbjigaxijm072lh7muiitg.mp3","text":"如果遇到意外状况，我会自行判断如何行动。","alt":"voice/char_4036_forcer/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9c/40u67sg5v132wpv65wk7rfhnpq9c6n4.mp3","text":"早点出发，早点休息。","alt":"voice/char_4036_forcer/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:d/db/eu1zovtx0yajq7o350tmbzkkl92d67k.mp3","text":"战斗中造成的损坏需要赔偿吗？","alt":"voice/char_4036_forcer/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fa/e3j1qhf8vpms31q551ls1tlk0rbxhh1.mp3","text":"听您安排。","alt":"voice/char_4036_forcer/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/15/lcv7whth24ul1t9s2ydrh6otpnoekax.mp3","text":"强制执行。","alt":"voice/char_4036_forcer/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9b/2q3itu6v33m8wmm6cqw912llimqwjln.mp3","text":"这场战斗并非因仇怨而起。","alt":"voice/char_4036_forcer/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/45/5jhlampb5l7bo1dgw89b7scf0b77axs.mp3","text":"大家只是立场各不相同罢了。","alt":"voice/char_4036_forcer/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9b/58z0g5dbhw83z2owmo0r162twjx1l48.mp3","text":"到此为止。","alt":"voice/char_4036_forcer/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/db/mdctabqt9htbttmedszs9alszlpitdq.mp3","text":"有理念支撑的争斗并非毫无意义。","alt":"voice/char_4036_forcer/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/29/lmztspsqf6lxxixfef145v1bgiwr2b9.mp3","text":"各位的想法我之后会听。","alt":"voice/char_4036_forcer/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/ce/n5s6a1aj2ivxkz3vp7fjwib7pcz0mpl.mp3","text":"各位请小心，不要从这里摔下去。","alt":"voice/char_4036_forcer/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ad/3lkxs2nom1ruzksf6rioi2psi3opi4k.mp3","text":"他们有他们的坚持，我们也有我们的。感谢您愿意去了解，博士。","alt":"voice/char_4036_forcer/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:3/30/7ce2ilhkz2iv6xg82r92ta0wun9vfjt.mp3","text":"任务完成。您也辛苦了，博士，回去好好休息吧。","alt":"voice/char_4036_forcer/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e0/2u8br0d1yqrp2lixo7egnj92rubpduw.mp3","text":"离开的那些人，他们是放弃了吗？还是......","alt":"voice/char_4036_forcer/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b2/oi7mpl0fabe9489tiqqum7rvwp8rx9e.mp3","text":"不必如此沮丧，我们还可以再尝试。","alt":"voice/char_4036_forcer/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"